{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "id": "msg_011CeSTsAd7CXWPVJSadS5cr", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "用户要求我将5句英文歌词翻译成中文（普通话/汉语）。用户要求：\n- 精确输出5行翻译\n- 编号1-5\n- 无解释、无注释\n\n当前模式是CAVEMAN MODE (full)，这意味着我应该简洁回应，但这里是翻译任务，用户明确要求\"不要解释，不要注释\"，所以我就直接输出翻译即可。\n\n让我翻译这5行歌词：\n\n1. My hands reach out to the sky\n   我的双手伸向天空\n\n2. to cup the rain that falls from the heavens,\n   托住从天堂坠落的雨\n\n3. but it's not rain that falls in my hands,\n   但落在我手心的不是雨\n\n4. it's the tears that drop from her eyes,\n   是从她眼中滑落的泪水\n\n5. and it's not the storm that brews in the heavens,\n   而天上酝酿的不是风暴\n\n让我再润色一下，确保自然流畅：\n\n1. 我的双手伸向天空\n2. 承接从天堂坠落的雨\n3. 可落在我手中的不是雨\n4. 而是从她眼中滑落的泪\n5. 天上酝酿的也不是风暴\n\n或者更富有诗意的版本：\n\n1. 我的双手伸向天空\n2. 去接那从天堂降落的雨\n3. 可落在我手里的并非雨\n4. 是从她眼睛滑落的泪水\n5. 天堂酝酿的也不是风暴\n\n第二版更流畅自然，就用这个。", "signature": ""}], "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 10, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1823, "cache_read_input_tokens": 35668, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1823}, "output_tokens": 1, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "not_available"}, "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "9132e96a-6c3d-4a03-aa7a-b592b4c3c858", "uuid": "9ab52607-48f4-43e2-adc7-1dbf0fa29898", "timestamp": "2026-08-27T02:28:13.799Z", "request_id": "req_011CeSTs9NwpQ3PKRHgwGSYX"}
